<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>SignDrop - CLFS Authentication Exposure V1.0</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<div><h2>SignDrop CLFS authentication exposure</h2>
<p>Read-only assessment of the published SignDrop configuration condition.
This Analysis does not run an exploit, scan files, change settings or remediate systems.</p>
<p><b>Vulnerable:</b> True when the CLFS authentication Mode is a valid REG_DWORD
equal to 0 (enforced) or 1 (learning). False when Mode is 2 (disabled by an
administrator) or 3 (disabled automatically). The second property reports the
same numeric Mode. Missing, unreadable, wrong-type or out-of-range values remain
unavailable/errors and must not be interpreted as False.</p>
<p>This is configuration exposure according to published research, not confirmed
exploitability or evidence of compromise. False does not establish overall CLFS
security. Do not disable CLFS authentication to make this result False: doing so
removes protection against malicious log files. Both properties evaluate every
15 minutes; reporting and offline-system delays still apply.</p>
<p>Source: <a href="https://github.com/MSNightmare/SignDrop/tree/87a33cd4abc90b158e13220741eca2a54b44eb74">SignDrop research, pinned November 10, 2026 revision</a>.
<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/kernel/clfs-authentication">Microsoft CLFS authentication documentation</a>.</p></div>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system and ((name of operating system starts with "Win11" and version of operating system >= version "10.0.26200") or (name of operating system starts with "Win2025" and version of operating system >= version "10.0.26100"))</Relevance>
    <Category>Security Configuration</Category>
    <Property Name="SignDrop::Vulnerable" ID="1" EvaluationPeriod="PT15M"><![CDATA[(it = 0 or it = 1) of (if not exists values "Mode" of keys "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\CLFS\Authentication" of native registry then error "CLFS authentication Mode is unavailable or not present; exposure unknown" else (if (type of it as string) != "REG_DWORD" then error "CLFS authentication Mode is not REG_DWORD; exposure unknown" else (if it < 0 or it > 3 then error "CLFS authentication Mode is outside 0-3; exposure unknown" else it) of (it as integer)) of value "Mode" of key "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\CLFS\Authentication" of native registry)]]></Property>
    <Property Name="SignDrop::CLFS Authentication Mode" ID="2" EvaluationPeriod="PT15M"><![CDATA[if not exists values "Mode" of keys "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\CLFS\Authentication" of native registry then error "CLFS authentication Mode is unavailable or not present; exposure unknown" else (if (type of it as string) != "REG_DWORD" then error "CLFS authentication Mode is not REG_DWORD; exposure unknown" else (if it < 0 or it > 3 then error "CLFS authentication Mode is outside 0-3; exposure unknown" else it) of (it as integer)) of value "Mode" of key "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\CLFS\Authentication" of native registry]]></Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
